<title>UK: UBS sets warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it had issued 20 million American-style call warrants, on Nestle registered shares.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,550.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	10.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.08 CHF		  GEARING	14.4 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   17.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	07.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,503.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
